{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_nest","model_identifier":"lair_nest","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_nest\n\nLair: nest (C6, spiders and gravewings), 6 m (213 u) across.\n\nA mound of dead branches and bones: a packed core of grey-brown sticks with branches criss-crossing out over it in layers, sheets of spider web strung between them (web textures are white strands on transparent pixels), pale egg sacs tucked into the tangle, bones and a skull caught in it and scattered around, and a dark hollow on top where the brood climbs out. Footprint 14 x 14 terrain columns (224 x 224 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 55 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -96.0..95.5, y 0.0..74.0, z -93.5..88.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mound: 200 x 66 x 200 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (or a 140 x 58 x 140 core box plus decoration)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 52.065, 0)\n- `fx_spawn_ground` on `root` at (0, 0, -76)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: the hollow on top (spiders crawl out, gravewings take off); `fx_spawn_ground`: front foot of the mound.\n- web_* cubes use transparent texture pixels; render with alpha test / cutout.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_nest_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_nest\n\nLair: nest (C6, spiders and gravewings), 6 m (213 u) across.\n\nA mound of dead branches and bones: a packed core of grey-brown sticks with branches criss-crossing out over it in layers, sheets of spider web strung between them (web textures are white strands on transparent pixels), pale egg sacs tucked into the tangle, bones and a skull caught in it and scattered around, and a dark hollow on top where the brood climbs out. Footprint 14 x 14 terrain columns (224 x 224 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 55 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -96.0..95.5, y 0.0..74.0, z -93.5..88.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mound: 200 x 66 x 200 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (or a 140 x 58 x 140 core box plus decoration)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 52.065, 0)\n- `fx_spawn_ground` on `root` at (0, 0, -76)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: the hollow on top (spiders crawl out, gravewings take off); `fx_spawn_ground`: front foot of the mound.\n- web_* cubes use transparent texture pixels; render with alpha test / cutout.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_nest_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"nest_core_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-75.0,0.0,-75.0],"to":[75.0,16.25,75.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[100,192,250.0,208.25],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[250,192,400.0,208.25],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,226,150.0,242.25],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[150,226,300.0,242.25],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,150.0,150.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"49056164-6662-5881-9712-ffac3d150c68"},{"name":"nest_core_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.3375,14.625,-60.3375],"to":[60.3375,27.625,60.3375],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0